1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:09,725
A fisherman chooses bait the fish like, not what the fisherman likes. Create things your audience genuinely wants, and they come to you.

2
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:21,120
Pick three to five content pillars: themes you post about again and again. Helpful recipes, behind the scenes, customer stories, and offers.

3
00:00:22,820 --> 00:00:30,345
Repurpose. One good guide becomes a blog post, five short videos, a carousel and an email.

4
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:38,740
Google rewards first-hand experience: real photos, real numbers, real tips, and a named author.

5
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:45,640
A recipe from a cook who explains what went wrong the first time beats a copied list.

6
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:58,040
People decide in two seconds whether to keep reading. Lead with a specific benefit, a question they are asking, a surprising fact, or a story.

7
00:00:58,740 --> 00:01:09,740
Plan a month ahead in a simple calendar. Consistency beats bursts. AI can help draft, but always add your own experience and check the facts.

